{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测macOS执行AppleScript后联网。对应需求：执行。官方：Apple Script Execution followed by Network Connection。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.network*","logs-endpoint.events.process*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】macOS执行AppleScript后联网","references":["https://developer.apple.com/library/archive/documentation/LanguagesUtilities/Conceptual/MacAutomationScriptingGuide/index.html","https://www.iana.org/assignments/iana-ipv4-special-registry/iana-ipv4-special-registry.xhtml"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"47f76567-d58a-4fed-b32b-21f571e28910","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 macOS 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: macOS","主题: 执行","来源: 默认","对应需求: 执行"],"type":"eql","query":"sequence by host.id, process.entity_id with maxspan=30s\n [process where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.type == \"start\" and process.name == \"osascript\"]\n [network where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.type == \"start\" and process.name == \"osascript\" and\n   not cidrmatch(destination.ip, \n       \"240.0.0.0/4\", \"233.252.0.0/24\", \"224.0.0.0/4\", \"198.19.0.0/16\", \"192.18.0.0/15\", \n       \"192.0.0.0/24\", \"10.0.0.0/8\", \"127.0.0.0/8\", \"169.254.0.0/16\", \"172.16.0.0/12\", \n       \"192.0.2.0/24\", \"192.31.196.0/24\", \"192.52.193.0/24\", \"192.168.0.0/16\", \"192.88.99.0/24\", \n       \"100.64.0.0/10\", \"192.175.48.0/24\", \"198.18.0.0/15\", \"198.51.100.0/24\", \"203.0.113.0/24\",\n       \"::1\", \"FE80::/10\", \"FF00::/8\")]\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nmacOS执行AppleScript后联网\n\n### 为何重要\n在主机上执行命令或脚本\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.002","name":"AppleScript","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1071","name":"Application Layer Protocol","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1071/"},{"id":"T1105","name":"Ingress Tool Transfer","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1105/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0011","name":"Command and Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":114,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
